cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the case study data, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "WOM: Weekly Operation Model"
abstract: >-
  WOM (Weekly Operation Model) is a Python-based global supply chain
  planning and simulation system, developed using a Vibe Modeling
  approach in dialogue with AI. It combines a lot-based weekly PSI
  (quantity) model with a Cost/Profit Structure Ratio (financial) model,
  bridging weekly operational execution with management decision-making.
  This repository includes industrial case studies across multiple
  sectors (e.g. confectionery, electric vehicles, apparel, smartphones,
  oil, rice, and other consumer/industrial goods) as reproducible
  research artifacts.
